# Copy to .dev.vars (test mode) or .live.vars (live mode). Both are gitignored.
# Never commit them, never paste their values into a chat, an email or a ticket.
#
# The command-line tools (stripe:setup, invite, plan, refund, migrate-prices,
# retention) read this file. The Worker gets the same values through
# `npx wrangler secret put NAME`, except STRIPE_SECRET_KEY: the scripts need
# the FULL key (sk_test_...), the Worker gets a RESTRICTED one (rk_test_...).
#
# INVITE_SIGNING_KEY and ADMIN_ACTION_KEY: two random strings of at least 32
# characters. Make each with:   openssl rand -base64 48
# They must be identical here and in the Worker.

STRIPE_SECRET_KEY="sk_test_..."
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET="whsec_..."
INVITE_SIGNING_KEY="..."
ADMIN_ACTION_KEY="..."
BREVO_API_KEY="xkeysib-..."
# Optional, test mode: every email goes to this address instead of the member.
EMAIL_OVERRIDE=""
